* Buck Converter - poprawiony netlist
* V_in=100V, L=100uH, C=100uF, f=50kHz, Duty=0.3..0.7

* === Zasilanie ===
Vin Vin 0 100

* === Sygnaly sterujace ===
* M1 (high-side) - normalny PWM
Vpwm1 PWM1 0 PULSE(0 10 0 10n 10n {Duty/Freq} {1/Freq})

* M2 (low-side) - komplementarny z dead time 500ns
Vpwm2 PWM2 0 PULSE(0 10 {Duty/Freq + 500n} 10n 10n {(1-Duty)/Freq - 1u} {1/Freq})

* === Tranzystory ===
M1 Vin PWM1 SW SW NMOS_PWR
M2 SW PWM2 0 0 NMOS_PWR

* === Diody body ===
D1 SW Vin 1N4148
D2 0 SW 1N4148

* === Filtr LC ===
L1 SW Vout 100u
C1 Vout 0 100u

* === Obciazenie ===
Rload Vout 0 100

* === Model tranzystora ===
.model NMOS_PWR NMOS(Level=1 Vto=2 Kp=10 Vmax=200 Ron=0.1)

* === Symulacja ===
.tran 0 10ms 0 1u UIC

* === Parametry ===
.param Duty=0.5
.param Freq=50k

* === Krok po Duty ===
.step param Duty 0.3 0.7 0.1

* === Wykresy ===
.plot V(Vout) I(L1) V(PWM1) V(PWM2)

* === Opcje solvera ===
.options gmin=1e-12 reltol=0.001

.end
